  "bodyHash": "iAnWPiUOydw=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"289\"></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Overview.png\" alt=\"概述\" width=\"1416\" height=\"114\"></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模组无需安装在服务器上，只需安装在客户端即可使用。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当挖掘时，如果快捷栏中有正确的工具，会自动切换到该工具。它也适用于模组工具。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你想禁用自动切换，可以在破坏方块时按住潜行键。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">还有一个快捷键（默认为G键）可以启用或禁用切换功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NYH2w773S84?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Bisect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"155\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#广告 #Ad&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/MelanX/ToolSwap/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上报告问题或提出建议。</span></p>",
